From d12d416d2f9f62bd6372868ea44e310fe986bb67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ColorfulRhino <131405023+ColorfulRhino@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 12:21:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Drop dev dependency @cyclonedx/cyclonedx-npm

This SBOM generator was superseded by "@cyclonedx/webpack-plugin",
but was never removed.

This also removes the transitive dependency "libxmljs2" which before
did no longer compile from source with Node >=22, breaking reproducable
builds from source (e.g. nixpkgs).

Signed-off-by: ColorfulRhino <131405023+ColorfulRhino@users.noreply.github.com>
